---
// Retrieval-augmented generation on one filing. Say a filing is 60,000 words, about 80,000 tokens
// (0.75 words per token), cut into 500-token chunks: 160 chunks. Top 5 chunks = 2,500 tokens = 3.1% of the filing.
// python3: 80000/500 = 160; 5*500 = 2500; 2500/80000 = 3.125%.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const steps = [
  { icon: 'doc', en: ['Filing', '~80,000 tokens'], vi: ['Báo cáo', '~80.000 token'] },
  { icon: 'package', en: ['Cut into chunks', '160 of 500 tokens'], vi: ['Cắt thành đoạn', '160 đoạn x 500 token'] },
  { icon: 'search', en: ['Search by question', 'keep the top 5'], vi: ['Tìm theo câu hỏi', 'giữ 5 đoạn đầu'] },
  { icon: 'model', en: ['Model answers', 'from those 2,500'], vi: ['Model trả lời', 'từ 2.500 token đó'] },
] as const;
const fails = [
  { n: '1', en: 'The right chunk is not in the top 5', vi: 'Đoạn đúng không nằm trong 5 đoạn đầu' },
  { n: '2', en: 'A table is cut in half, the row loses its header', vi: 'Bảng bị cắt đôi, dòng số mất tiêu đề' },
  { n: '3', en: 'The model ignores the chunks and answers from memory', vi: 'Model bỏ qua các đoạn và trả lời theo trí nhớ' },
];
---
<figure class="a21r">
  <div class="a21r-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 372" role="img" aria-label="Retrieval-augmented generation. A filing of about 80,000 tokens is cut into 160 chunks of 500 tokens. A search keeps the top 5 chunks, 2,500 tokens or about 3 percent of the filing. The model answers from those. Three places it fails: the right chunk is not retrieved, a table is cut in half, or the model answers from memory.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="a21r-h"><tspan data-lang-en>RAG: the model sees only the few pieces the search hands it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>RAG: model chỉ thấy vài đoạn mà bước tìm kiếm đưa cho</tspan></text>
      {steps.map((s, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={20 + i * 220} y="52" width="190" height="84" rx="8" class={i === 2 ? 'a21r-box is-key' : 'a21r-box'} />
          <DiagramIcon name={s.icon} x={20 + i * 220 + 26} y="80" size={22} />
          <text x={20 + i * 220 + 14} y="112" class="a21r-t"><tspan data-lang-en>{s.en[0]}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi[0]}</tspan></text>
          <text x={20 + i * 220 + 14} y="128" class="a21r-s"><tspan data-lang-en>{s.en[1]}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{s.vi[1]}</tspan></text>
          {i < 3 && <polygon points={`${20 + i * 220 + 214},94 ${20 + i * 220 + 204},88 ${20 + i * 220 + 204},100`} class="a21r-head" />}
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="20" y="170" class="a21r-s"><tspan data-lang-en>The model reads 2,500 of 80,000 tokens, 3.1% of the filing.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Model đọc 2.500 trong 80.000 token, tức 3,1% báo cáo.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="180" width="860" height="14" rx="3" class="a21r-bar" />
      <rect x="20" y="180" width="27" height="14" rx="3" class="a21r-bar is-read" />
      <text x="20" y="226" class="a21r-ct"><tspan data-lang-en>Three ways the answer still goes wrong</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ba cách câu trả lời vẫn sai</tspan></text>
      {fails.map((f, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={20 + i * 292} y="240" width="276" height="76" rx="8" class="a21r-fail" />
          <circle cx={20 + i * 292 + 24} cy="278" r="13" class="a21r-num" />
          <text x={20 + i * 292 + 24} y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="a21r-t is-on">{f.n}</text>
          <foreignObject x={20 + i * 292 + 46} y="246" width="220" height="64">
            <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" class="a21r-fp"><span data-lang-en>{f.en}</span><span data-lang-vi>{f.vi}</span></p>
          </foreignObject>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="20" y="348" class="a21r-s"><tspan data-lang-en>FinanceBench (2023): GPT-4-Turbo with a retrieval system answered wrongly or refused on 81% of its questions.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>FinanceBench (2023): GPT-4-Turbo kèm hệ truy xuất trả lời sai hoặc từ chối 81% câu hỏi.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Say one annual report runs 60,000 words. At 0.75 words per token that is about 80,000 tokens; five 500-token chunks are about 3% of it.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giả sử một báo cáo thường niên dài 60.000 từ. Với 0,75 từ mỗi token, đó là khoảng 80.000 token; năm đoạn 500 token chỉ chiếm khoảng 3%.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .a21r { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .a21r-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .a21r svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .a21r text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .a21r .a21r-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21r .a21r-t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21r .a21r-t.is-on { fill: var(--bg); }
  .a21r .a21r-s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .a21r .a21r-ct { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .a21r .a21r-fp { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text-body); font-family: inherit; }
  .a21r-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .a21r-box.is-key { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .a21r-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .a21r-bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .a21r-bar.is-read { fill: var(--gold-icon); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .a21r-fail { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .a21r-num { fill: var(--red); }
  .a21r figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
